---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an tr" viewBox="0 0 480 222" role="img" aria-label="A transfer moves 30 between two balances; a transfer larger than the balance is refused"><rect class="nd " x="24" y="40" width="150" height="100" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="34" y="49" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="110.0" y="65" text-anchor="middle">account:a</text><rect class="nd " x="306" y="40" width="150" height="100" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="316" y="49" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="392.0" y="65" text-anchor="middle">account:b</text><path class="ln" d="M174 90 L306 90"/><g class="tr-w0"><text class="b" x="106" y="112" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:24px">100</text><text class="b" x="388" y="112" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:24px">20</text></g><g class="tr-w1"><text class="b" x="106" y="112" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:24px">70</text><text class="b" x="388" y="112" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:24px">50</text></g><g class="tr-w5"><circle class="pk" cx="174" cy="90" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:132px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/><text class="sm" x="240" y="78" text-anchor="middle">30</text></g><g class="tr-w6"><circle class="pk" cx="174" cy="90" r="5" fill="var(--bad)" style="--dx:60px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/><text class="sm" x="215" y="78" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">90?</text></g><g class="tr-w7"><text class="sm" x="240" y="128" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">✕ not enough</text></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="176" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="tr-w2"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--c2)">TRANSFER a b 30 …</text></g><g class="tr-w3"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle">Moved in one atomic step: a 70, b 50.</text></g><g class="tr-w4 an-fin"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">TRANSFER a b 90 is refused. Balances stay put.</text></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Balances that cannot go negative</b>TRANSFER moves an amount between two keys only when the source holds enough.</figcaption>
</figure>
